    "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Key Benefits</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Low profile for bone grafting<br>\n</li>\n<li>Open neck for bone grafting<br>\n</li>\n<li>Multiple eccentric heads composed of Cobalt-chromium alloy<br>\n</li>\n<li>Polished medial neck to avoid suture abrasion<br>\n</li>\n<li>Titanium Alloy polished stem for use with cement<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
